{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40903","headline":"题桃源僧 · 陈光","name":"题桃源僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桃源有僧舍，跬步异人天。\n花乱似无主，鹤鸣疑有仙。\n轩廊明野色，松桧湿春烟。\n定拟辞尘境，依师过晚年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}